    "storyline": {
      "real": "Montoya leads from the start until Schumacher goes for the lead at turn 2 on lap 16 and both run off the road, which hands Barrichello the lead. Coulthard, up from seventh on the grid, has saved fuel: he stops three laps after Barrichello, comes out ahead and wins by 2.19 s. Ferrari have Barrichello give second to Schumacher at the last corner."
