    },
    "briefing": "A1-Ring, 2001. Schumacher started on pole and Coulthard seventh. You run Coulthard, second after 44 laps, a second behind Barrichello with Schumacher right behind you, and none of the three has stopped. You saved fuel early: stay out longer than the Ferrari and win.",
